    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how do u even start fresh when the damage is already done? like, i look at my mom or my brother and i just see how stressed i make them. i see them holding back so they don't upset me. it feels like i'm just poisoning everything i'm a part of. i don't know how to stop being a problem for them.",
