    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "leave them behind? like just moving away? i don't think it works like that. i think i mean... if i'm not around, the stress stops. they wouldn't have to walk on eggshells anymore. it feels like the only way to actually stop being a burden is to just not be a factor in their lives at all. like, if i wasn't here, they could finally just breathe. doesn't that sound like the only kind thing i could actually do for them?",
